tex=\"j,M,N,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(j,M,N,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcHugeCardinalEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcHugeCardinalEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}huge\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcHugeCardinalEmbedding}_S(j,M,N,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\land\nj(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;j(\\alpha)=\\alpha\\land\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(s,j(\\kappa),\\mathrm{Univ}(N))\\to s\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}huge\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcHugeCardinalEmbedding}_S(j,M,N,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\land\nj(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;j(\\alpha)=\\alpha\\land\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(s,j(\\kappa),\\mathrm{Univ}(N))\\to s\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a set-model-relative huge-embedding witness; all membership and closure clauses use the canonical carriers of the source and target structures rather than their tuple encodings.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[..